ually resurrected  but in fact remained dead although he  walked the earth thinking he was still  alive after being bonded to the spirit  of divine vengeance ostrinder also  revealed that the source of the  specter's powers is actually god himself  and that the specter as an entity had  existed since the creation of man and  was actually the embodiment of god's  wrath now over time the spectre had come  to reject the idea of mercy and so it  was bonded to a series of human hosts  and hoped their humanity would temper  its wrath  and corgan was merely the latest in that  line of hosts we also learned that the  spectre was previously an angel named  aztar and incited with lucifer during  his rebellion but after repenting for  his betrayal receive the role of being  god's wrath as a punishment and so what  makes killing the specter such a  difficult endeavor well as i stated  earlier this spectre is one of the most  powerful entities in the dc  universe he's omniscient and nearly  omnipotent immortal capable of matter  and reality manipulation  time travel and telekinesis and so there  isn't much that's outside of the  specter's ability to achieve  he's proficient in magic and is able to  turn humans into trees and pillars of  salt and is said to be a far more apt  sorcerer than dr fate who's thought to  be one of the most powerful  proficient magic wielders in dc he can  alter his own size to massive  proportions at one point becoming so  large that the distance between his eyes  measured 23 light years his energy  manipulation powers are so vast that he  was able to create a supernova in the  palm of his hand  the spectre's ability to manipulate  reality has allowed him to neutralize  the effects of darkseid's omega beams  and was able to forge a nexus that  linked all realities  he was able to break through the source  wall a feat that was thought to be  impossible and is battled with the  anti-monitor during crisis on  infinitives produced enough energy to  destroy the entire dc multiverse and  created a new status quo in the form of  an entirely new universe referred to as  new universe and so the question we have  to answer is how to kill a being of such  immense power well luckily for us  despite  me saying that he is immortal earlier  the spectre can and has been killed  before he is immortal in the sense that  he will never die of natural causes or  old age but there are actually a couple  of ways that he can be killed the first  is by a being that's able to wield magic  to a sufficient  degree while this seems simple we need  to keep in mind that the amount of  magical power that would be needed to  destroy  the spectre in its entirety is  incredibly hard to achieve  as i mentioned earlier dr fate is  considered one of the most adept magical  sorcerers in the dc  universe and he was unable to muster  enough magic to defeat the spectre in  fact the mesopotamian deity that is the  source of dr fate's magic  also known as naboo was actually killed  by the specter which prompted the  presence the supreme deity of the dc  universe punished the specter in turn  now while it may seem extremely  difficult to find a source of magic  strong enough  it's not impossible the spectre is  nearly omnipotent but not  totally omnipotent meaning that there  are limitations to its power he can be  weakened by expending energy and in a  weakened state he becomes more  vulnerable to magical attacks in fact he  was killed by eclipso the entity that  was the embodiment of god's wrath  prior to the spectre taking over that  role now how this came about was that  eclipso brainwashed several members of  the justice league and caused them to  attack the specter with the specter worn  down  eclipsa was able to slice him in two  with his mystical sword and absorb his  essence unfortunately it's going to be  difficult to wield as much magic as  eclipso who despite not being one of the  most well-known villains in dc comics is  definitely among the most powerful  however i do think that this offers us a  clue  into a way to kill the spectre firstly  we're going to need to mount an  offensive of beings with a sufficient  enough power level to require him to  expend  a great deal of energy fighting them at  that point we capitalize on the  spectre's weakened state and  vulnerability to magic by using an  artifact of divine or mystical power to  deliver the killing blow  one such artifact that comes to mind is  the spear of destiny the weapon used to  pierce the side of jesus christ at his  crucifixion now the funny thing about  this is that the spear of destiny does  exist within the dc continuity and has  been used against the specter with  debilitating effects one of the other  crazy things  is that the spear actually came into  possession of the american president  bill clinton who gave it to superman to  slay the specter who was raging out of  control at this point and it was thought  the spear of destiny was the only weapon  in existence  capable of taking the specter out and so  as it turns out the sphere contained a  corrupting influence  placed in it and it threatened to  corrupt superman before he rejected it  and so the specter then encased the  spear in a boulder and sent it into  space  luckily for us the spear has since been  retrieved from space and was later  purified by the question  so if we can come into possession of the  spear we don't have to worry about being  corrupted and i really think that using  the sphere is our only reasonable chance  for success  short of having the presence himself  battle the specter as he's able to  exercise absolute control over him since  the spectre is effectively an extension  of the presence  and so that's how i think that we would  do it let me know what you guys think  down in the comments section i'm really  curious to see what ideas you guys come  up with if you are new here to comments  explain  make sure you guys hit the sub button to  become part of the rob core if you guys  enjoyed this video make sure you drop a  like and i will catch you all later  [Music]  peace  [Music]  is  [Music]  is  [Music]  me

